        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "revenue_1997_recommendation",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "### Which metric should the business report?\n",
                "The business should report **Net of Discount** as its revenue figure. This reflects the actual revenue the company expects to receive after customer discounts are applied.\n",
                "\n",
                "* **Gross Extended Price** overstates revenue by ignoring committed discounts.\n",
                "* **Net of Discount & Tax** includes tax collected on behalf of tax authorities — tax is not company revenue.\n",
                "* **Net of Discount** gives the most accurate picture of earned revenue."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 15,
            "width": 6,
            "height": 6
          }
        },
